{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51458","headline":"九华楼 · 霍总","name":"九华楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东门带溪路，上有三丈楼。\n层基接重阜，一览山水周。\n天边九芙蓉，出没不可求。\n鸿惊晓霜净，花明雨初收。\n巉然倚圭璧，爽气凌尊筹。\n主人金闺彦高兴思穷幽。\n时来据绳床，山色供远眸。\n危峯曳游云，岭月悬曲钧。\n吟嘨意不浅，浩然追轲丘。\n明年鸡省梦，肯忘江上州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"霍总","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}